 gaps

Preserve investigation for t_eeeeee0000000033; NOT READY TO SHIP.

Reproduced four RED failures before edits. The current bounded candidate and
projection implementation passes 46 consumer files (1227 tests), 38 new cases,
three split-module guards and scripts/check's 21 checks. Nine behavior mutants
are killed after aging turn-boundary fixtures to avoid grace-window masking.
Read-only hub replay examined 30 relevant notices across 12 stores; nine final
superseded rows and nine exact creator notices change classification.

Independent precommit reasoning found a release blocker: making every legacy
superseded row transparent can hide unrelated events in mixed notice batches.
Before publication/review/ship, bind settlement proof to pure source content and
preserve legacy mixed notices. Also fail closed on transient creator source-read
errors instead of allowing the outer guarantee to stamp a final error.

The original chat naturally received a genuine close-out reply during diagnosis;
this unpublished code did not recover it. No messages were injected into it.
